When the Situk River is flooded,  Old Situk is a GORGEOUS little river!  Not enough water under normal circumstances,  but in high water,  it flows clear and is filled with aggressive salmon.  These silvers are red and not what you'd want to eat,  but holy cow!  They are a lot of fun!  Looking for groups of 6-8 males,  avoiding the pairs of spawners,  the bucks are territorial and showing off for the other fish around them.  This behavior is all about posturing and testosterone.  Both for the fishermen and the fish...